This fixture exercises phpc's deterministic placeholder
`mysqli_stmt_execute()` plus `mysqli_stmt_get_result()` behavior for an
unbound prepared statement using the current seed-post WordPress SELECT shape.
System PHP requires a real initialized MySQLi connection and mysqlnd result
transfer; phpc only maps the known placeholder query shape to deterministic
rows and does not implement binding, parameter execution, mutation execution,
host database state, PHP warning/error fidelity, or native database lowering.
